notes.notes:
[h1]This is a major update, which saw many aspects of the game reviewed and polished a bit.[/h1]

[h2]Most notably, of course, [b]25 different arenas[/b] were added to the game.
They get unlocked as you progress, and offer variety to matches; some requiring quite different strategies. Old good plain empty field is still occasionally added to the mix.[/h2]

[h2]Other changes include:[/h2]

[h3]Quality of Life[/h3]
[list]
[*] Hints for starters that will help new players make their first step;
[*] Match starting animation is now skippable! Just click or press any key;
[*] Game performance was optimised. Not that the game really required it, but it will help battery charge last longer when played on a laptop;
[/list]

[h3]Visuals[/h3]
[list]
[*] Gem brightness was tuned;
[*] Conquered blocks of gems now fuse together into bigger gems!
[*] Fixed a visual glitch where next move selection animation continued to play while in Esc menu;
[/list]

[h3]Audio[/h3]
[list]
[*] Some minor tuning, balance is better, erm, balanced;
[*] A different sound effect when turn results in a large area surrounded and taken over;
[/list]

[h3]Achievements[/h3]
[list]
[*] New achievement: Explorer;
[*] Achievement conditions reworded to be applicable to variable field size: Resounding Victory and So Close;
[*] Some achievements will now indicate progress toward them;
[/list]

[h2]Thank you for reading this!

Please share in [b]Discussions[/b] section which changes you liked or not quite, and report any bugs you notice.[/h2]
